sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Outdoor Object & Finder
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Sensors as Cam/GPS
    participant AI as AI Engine
    participant Map as Map Service
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    par Visual Detection
        Sensors->>AI: Camera Frame
        AI->>TTS: Detect "Car" / "Tree"
    and Location Finder
        Sensors->>Map: Current GPS Coords
        Map->>Map: Find nearest "Bench"
        Map-->>TTS: "Bench is 10 meters North"
    end
    
    TTS->>Blind User: "Car ahead... Bench is 10 meters North"
